  "title": "How to Change your Discord Account's Email",
  "url": "https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/4423385681175-How-to-Change-your-Discord-Account-s-Email",
  "locale": "en-us",
  "created_at": "2022-02-10T23:26:28Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-31T16:45:56Z",
  "author": null,
  "summary": null,
  "thumbnail_url": null,
  "body": "<div class=\"toc-box\">\n<strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-x-large\">What this article covers:</span><br></strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#h_01JHK77EZKJ3ZE36CZ556FWGVT\">Desktop/Browser</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#h_01JHK77EZK1EHYN9EBVSBXNP9E\">Mobile</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tip-box\">\n<strong>Note: </strong>The Discord Support Team cannot change the email address associated with your account. To update your email, you'll need access to the inbox of your current email address.</div>\n<h1 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKJ3ZE36CZ556FWGVT\">Desktop/Browser</h1>\n<p>1. Tap on the <strong>cogwheel </strong>[<img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522008727\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">] next to your Discord username to access your <strong>User Settings</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522013335\" width=\"424\" height=\"94\"></span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKF4VM3KT49EGKQGAF\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of the cogwheel icon through Discord desktop/browser</span></h4>\n<p>2. Make sure you're on the <strong>My Account</strong> tab.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223530360343\" width=\"624\" height=\"427\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZK4W3N50EF5SCA19Q0\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">The </span><strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">My Account</span></strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"> tab located in your User Settings</span>\n</h4>\n<p>3. Press the <strong>Edit</strong> button next to your account's current email address.</p>\n<p id=\"h_01JHK77EZKAHYVXRBM849GP2E2\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522023191\" width=\"624\" height=\"452\"></span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKFPBS4WNH5C1X31PV\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of what the </span><strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Edit</span></strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"> button looks like in your My Account tab</span>\n</h4>\n<p>4. Follow the instructions of the in-client pop-up to change the email address then press <strong>Done</strong> once completed.</p>\n<p id=\"h_01JHK77EZKCESJB2BYM56ZZR3N\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522027927\" width=\"461\" height=\"457\"></span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZK68M5944Y9S1DNS10\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of what the Enter an email address pop-up looks like</span></h4>\n<p>5. Be sure to check the inbox of your updated email address for a verification email!</p>\n<h1 id=\"h_01JHK77EZK1EHYN9EBVSBXNP9E\">Mobile</h1>\n<p>1. Head over to your <strong>User Profile</strong> by selecting your <strong>avatar icon</strong> in the bottom-right corner. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223530376599\" width=\"371\" height=\"805\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKXY9X7H0MFEV75GT7\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of the avatar icon in the bottom-right corner of the mobile app</span></h4>\n<p>2.  Tap on the <strong>cogwheel </strong>[<img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522008727\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">] in the top-right corner.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522039575\" width=\"360\" height=\"779\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZK2AT6VY7M9DGV3D4A\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of the cogwheel icon to tap to access your User Settings</span></h4>\n<p>3. Tap on <strong>Account</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522040471\" width=\"312\" height=\"678\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKRT6B438E2ZST8D2Y\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of the </span><strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Account </span></strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">tab in the mobile app</span>\n</h4>\n<p>4. Tap on your current email address to change it.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522045335\" width=\"382\" height=\"827\"></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZKPNTYYWGBQZ521WYC\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of the </span><strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Account </span></strong><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">tab</span>\n</h4>\n<p>4. Follow the on-screen instructions to change your email. Once completed, tap on <strong>Change Email</strong>.</p>\n<p id=\"h_01JHK77EZMT9661JQ8HX7QTRHE\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/29223522047127\" width=\"364\" height=\"788\"></span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h_01JHK77EZMVZZKAFD8J2XGV8N6\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Example of what it looks like when you go to change your email address</span></h4>\n<p>5. Be sure to check the inbox of your updated email address for a verification email.</p>\n<div class=\"form-box\">\n<strong>Note:</strong> If your email was changed and you want to undo it for any reason, please check out the <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/27299669812375\">My Discord Email was Changed and I Want to Undo It</a> Help Center article.</div>",
